{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"LOAD 1,\u0022Graphics/Bobs/Solarsystem/04.png\u0022\nBOB 1,0,0,1\nBOB HANDLE 1,32,32\nBOB ZOOM 1,200,200\n\nBOB ON 1\n\nLOAD \u0022Graphics/berg.png\u0022\nI=0\nV=0\nX=0\nLoop:\n   SCROLL 0,I,0\n   BOB MOVE 1,2,0 \n   BOB ROTATE 1,V\n   INC V\n   DEC X\n   DEC I\n   IF BOB#X(1) \u003E 640 THEN \n      BOB MOVE 1,-640,0\n   ENDIF\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO Loop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}